<title>BERMUDA: YACHTING-BRUT GOLD CUP MATCH RACING RESULTS.</title>
<headline>YACHTING-BRUT GOLD CUP MATCH RACING RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of match</p>
<p>races in the Brut Gold Cup yachting series on Thursday (first</p>
<p>to win three races advances):</p>
<p>Round One:</p>
<p>Russell Coutts (New Zealand) beat Murray Jones (New Zealand)</p>
<p>3-1</p>
<p>Jochen Schumann (Germany) beat Peter Bromby (Bermuda) 3-1</p>
<p>Thierry Peponnet (France) beat Per Petterson (Sweden) 3-2</p>
<p>Chris Law (Britain) beat Glenn Astwood (Bermuda) 3-0</p>
<p>Peter Gilmour (Australia) beat Andrei Nikolaev (Russia) 3-0</p>
<p>Peter Holmberg (U.S. Virgin Islands) beat Henrik Lundberg</p>
<p>(Finland) 3-0</p>
<p>Markus Wieser (Germany) beat Adam Barboza (Bermuda) 3-0</p>
<p>Ed Baird (U.S.) beat Johan Peterson (Sweden) 3-1</p>
<p>Friday's quarter-final pairings: Coutts v Schumann,</p>
<p>Peponnet v Law, Gilmour v Holmberg, Wieser v Baird</p>
</text>
